{"asset_key":"ep1/gameplay_story_11601010","episode":"ep1","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"11601010","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1160101001:0":{"text":"킁! 이 근처에 보물 냄새가 나요. 마법사님, 저랑 같이 보물을 찾으러 가요!","source_cn":"嗅！这附近有宝藏的味道。魔法师大人，跟鼠一起寻宝吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3070BCA2866734BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1160101002:0":{"text":"제가 땅속으로 파고 들어가 보물을 찾을 테니, 마법사님께서는 땅 위에 마법 탐색기를 놓아주세요.","source_cn":"鼠会钻进地下寻宝，魔法师大人要做的，就是在地面上放置魔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A4D6263E4191A54","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:3::0":{"text":"보물찾기 표시","source_cn":"寻宝信标","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0BFF0BB4CD02B25A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1160101003:0":{"text":"마법 탐색기가 보물이 숨겨진 구역을 알려줄 테니, 마법사님께서는 계속해서 탐색기를 놓아 범위를 좁혀주세요.","source_cn":"魔法信标会指示出宝藏的区域，请魔法师大人持续放信标，帮...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F7CCA05F5D008CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1160101004:0":{"text":"마법 탐색기를 정확한 위치에 놓으면 보물이 표시돼요!","source_cn":"魔法信标放在正确的位置之后，宝藏就能显示出来咯！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A6227E8B5E4A470","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_